It uses only Apple system frameworks (AppKit, Metal, CoreGraphics, ScreenCaptureKit, CryptoKit) and has no
third-party code dependencies. It optionally loads Apple's private MultitouchSupport framework at runtime
(three-finger trigger, off by default); that framework is not distributed with this project.
